// FOUR DATES, ONE FILE: THE 2016 REFORM CORRIDOR.
//
// The same reticence on value and the same imperfect performance are dated
// 30 September 2016, 1 October 2016, 2017 and 2019. The page names the
// applicable law, the 1137 wording, and the 1223 wording. 30 September 2016
// is the declared boundary of the model, not an absence of law.
//
// The showcase dossier `contrat-dans-le-temps` is left as it is.
